  "description": "Code and reproduction artifact for the LawKAN paper: a KAN-style architecture for composition under a known group law (exact node + learned edge + optional zero-initialized correction to the law). Tested on SU(2), GL+(2,R) and SE(3); real robot-arm calibration, IMUs and a gyroscope; 120 canonical blocks and 171 mechanical number checks.",
